+    "obligationIsKept": "(null, null) does not weaken anything. The account stays incomplete, the cell row stays partial, a required cell still emits its requiredCellDeficiencies row, and composition section 9.6 maps the null deficiency to proof cause required-cell-unsatisfied with the ExecutionInputsV1 ref plus the originating refs. Nothing here may promote incomplete extraction to complete.",
+    "realCarriersSurvive": "Where a retained inventory, Coverage, candidate or binding record DOES carry a typed pair, that exact pair and its originating ref are kept. Inventory budget-exhausted is never rewritten as provider-unavailable, a sibling record's carrier is never borrowed, and every per-record triple stays on derivedAccounts[].coverageRecords."
